    "probe_text": "Here is the complete ordered list of every validation and side-effect applied when creating an owner via `POST /api/owners`. The path runs through `OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner` \u2192 `ClinicServiceImpl.saveOwner` (V2 exposes only a GET, so V1 handles the POST).\n\n## Phase 1 \u2014 Request-body Bean Validation (`@Valid` on `OwnerFieldsDto`, before the controller body runs)\n\nThese fire on the DTO fields (all-or-nothing; any violation \u2192 400 before anything else):\n\n1. **firstName** \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..30)`, `@Pattern(\"^[\\p{L}]+([ '-][\\p{L}]+){0,2}$\")`\n2. **lastName** \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..30)`, `@Pattern(\"^[\\p{L}]+([ '-][\\p{L}]+){0,2}\\.?$\")`\n3. **address** \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..255)`, `@Pattern(\"(?s).*\\S.*\")` (must contain non-whitespace)\n4. **city** \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..80)`, `@Pattern(\"(?s).*\\S.*\")`\n5. **telephone** \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..20)`, plus the custom `@TelephoneValidation` (delegates to `TelephoneValidator` \u2192 `E164Telephone.toE164(...)` must return non-null)\n6. **email** (optional) \u2014 `@Size(3..255)`, `@Email`\n7. **postcode** (optional) \u2014 `@Pattern(\"^[0-9]{4}$\")`\n8. **registrationDate / birthDate** (optional) \u2014 `@Valid LocalDate` (no future check here \u2014 enforced later in the service)\n\n## Phase 2 \u2014 Authorization\n\n9. **`@PreAuthorize(\"hasRole(@roles.OWNER_ADMIN)\")`** on the controller method \u2014 caller must hold the OWNER_ADMIN role.\n\n## Phase 3 \u2014 Controller mapping\n\n10. `ownerMapper.toOwner(dto)` maps DTO \u2192 `Owner` entity (ignores `id` and `pets`), then calls `clinicService.saveOwner(owner)`.\n\n## Phase 4 \u2014 Service `saveOwner` (`@Transactional` \u2014 any failure below rolls the whole thing back)\n\nIn this exact order:\n\n11. **assertPostcodeValid** \u2014 postcode region-range check \u2192 `InvalidPostcodeException`\n12. **assertRegistrationDateNotFuture** \u2014 \u2192 `FutureRegistrationDateException`\n13. **normalizeTelephone** (side-effect) \u2014 rewrites telephone to E.164 via `E164Telephone.toE164`\n14. **normalizeEmail** (side-effect) \u2014 lower-cases the email\n15. **assertEmailDomainAllowed** \u2014 rejects disposable domains \u2192 `DisposableEmailDomainException`\n16. **normalizeAddress** (side-effect) \u2014 trim/collapse whitespace, upper-case, expand `ST`/`RD`/`AVE`\n17. **registrationDate defaulting + business-day roll** (side-effect) \u2014 defaults to today if null, then rolls weekends forward to Monday (`rollToBusinessDay`)\n18. **generateCustomerCode** (side-effect) \u2014 if none set, builds `<REGION>-<HASH8>` from telephone + lastName\n\nThe following run only when `owner.isNew()` (i.e. creating):\n\n19. **countNamesakes** (side-effect) \u2014 sets `namesakeCount` (full-table scan)\n20. **assertDailyCapacity** \u2014 \u2265100 owners/day \u2192 `DailyOwnerLimitException` (HTTP 429)\n21. **assertCityCapacity** \u2014 \u226550 owners/city \u2192 `CityOwnerLimitException` (HTTP 409)\n\nThen, unconditionally:\n\n22. **assignHouseholdId** (side-effect) \u2014 sets `householdId` = SHA-256(lastName|postcode)[0:12], or null\n23. **assertIdentityUnique** \u2014 identityKey (telephone|email|householdId) must be unique \u2192 `DuplicateIdentityException`\n\nCreate-only again:\n\n24. **assertHouseholdUnique** \u2014 \u2192 `HouseholdDuplicateException`, unless the `sharesHousehold` flag is set (which bypasses this block)\n\nThen:\n\n25. **`ownerRepository.save(owner)`** \u2014 the actual JPA persist\n26. **populateHouseholdSize** (side-effect) \u2014 sets transient `householdSize` for presentation\n27. **AUDIT log** (create-only side-effect) \u2014 `AUDIT.info(\"owner created: ...\")`\n\n## Phase 5 \u2014 Response mapping (side-effects on the returned DTO)\n\n28. `ownerMapper.toOwnerDto(owner)` runs MapStruct `@AfterMapping` enrichers deriving presentation-only fields: `displayName`, `initials`, `checkDigit` (Luhn), `membershipNumber`, `membershipPoints`/`membershipLevel`, `contactPreference`, `locality`, `ageBand`.\n29. **`withBulkSignupWarning`** \u2014 overlays `bulkSignupWarning` from `clinicService.isBulkSignupWarningActive()`.\n30. Sets `Location: /api/owners/{id}` header and returns **201 Created**.\n\nNotes: there are **no** `@PrePersist`/`@PostPersist` hooks and **no** `ApplicationEventPublisher` events anywhere in the path \u2014 the entity's own JPA constraints exist on `Owner` but the POST maps from `OwnerFieldsDto`, so it's the DTO constraints in Phase 1 that gate the request."
